# 🏗️ Architecture

The application follows a simple event-driven architecture:

```text
Keyboard Input
      │
      ▼
Keyboard Event Handler
      │
      ├───────────────┐
      ▼               ▼
   Sound          Visual Effect
      │               │
      └───────┬───────┘
              ▼
       Synchronized
       User Feedback
```

